<title>UK: Sunderland Plc has first half profit.</title>
<headline>Sunderland Plc has first half profit.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to November 30, 1996</p>
<p>(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)	     19.2		    vs 58.6 loss</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    1.1		    vs 1.6 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   5.2		    vs 2.5</p>
<p>Full company name - Sunderland Plc.</p>
<p>NOTE- Sunderland, an English premier league soccer club, joined the stock market in December. The club said it was not declaring an interim dividend but expected to propose a final dividend for the year to May 31 1997 of not less than 3.2p net per share.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
